# Troubleshooting

Troubleshooting entries use a consistent structure: observable symptom, likely
cause, minimal public correction, and a supported inspection method. They must
not depend on private ggaction source files or renderer internals.

Before diagnosing a feature, confirm the installed package versions and run:

```sh
npm run spec:validate
npm run verify
```
